# TEASER: declare PR scope

> This is a Driftwatch teaser rule, not the full kit.

Before editing, write down which paths you are allowed to touch. Do not
"just fix" a second package in the same PR. A title that names one file
is not permission to edit its sibling.

The paid pack requires a machine-parseable `Scope:` block, forbids
formatting-only drive-bys, and fails CI (`out_of_scope`) when the diff
escapes that list. This teaser does not.
